(4342435, 625849, 70689, '<td valign="top">Great expression from the kid and I like how grandpa is still recognizable. I am a bit bothered by the large number of distractions all over the pic, giving it a snapshottish feel. Especially the white/blue bottle (?) in the upper right corner is distracting. I also think the crop is just too tight below. Nevertheless, a nice pic.</td>', 'Great expression from the kid and I like how grandpa is still recognizable. I am a bit bothered by the large number of distractions all over the pic, giving it a snapshottish feel. Especially the white/blue bottle (?) in the upper right corner is distracting. I also think the crop is just too tight below. Nevertheless, a nice pic.', '2007-12-29 03:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342436, 625939, 70689, '<td valign="top">Funny and technically well done. I am not too thrilled with the composition though, would have liked the phone closer to the woman to avoid the large open space above the phone. Also not too fond of the brown on black, but these are fairly minor issues.</td>', 'Funny and technically well done. I am not too thrilled with the composition though, would have liked the phone closer to the woman to avoid the large open space above the phone. Also not too fond of the brown on black, but these are fairly minor issues.', '2007-12-29 03:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342437, 625703, 70689, '<td valign="top">Great facial expression and the use of a deep DOF is very functional here. I am not too fond of the POV though. The high angle makes the head look extra large. Furthermore, there seems to be a halo around the head.</td>', 'Great facial expression and the use of a deep DOF is very functional here. I am not too fond of the POV though. The high angle makes the head look extra large. Furthermore, there seems to be a halo around the head.', '2007-12-29 03:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342444, 626188, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the "Big G". He has a cool roar.</td>', 'I like the "Big G". He has a cool roar.', '2007-12-29 03:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342445, 625500, 70689, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and well executed. I don''t know whether it''s the lighting or PP, but the pics seems a bit oversharpened to me.</td>', 'Nice idea and well executed. I don''t know whether it''s the lighting or PP, but the pics seems a bit oversharpened to me.', '2007-12-29 03:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
