(4342449, 626039, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like someone ate all the cereal and you are searching for the toy at the bottom.</td>', 'Looks like someone ate all the cereal and you are searching for the toy at the bottom.', '2007-12-29 03:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342450, 625755, 70689, '<td valign="top">Nice. Love the use of shallow DOF combined with the suggestion of nudity. Not clear to me why the cube misses the centers and has a hole. Is this a specific type or is it justbroken? I find the shadows of the hand and cube a bit distracting, whereas the overall lighting is so much better.</td>', 'Nice. Love the use of shallow DOF combined with the suggestion of nudity. Not clear to me why the cube misses the centers and has a hole. Is this a specific type or is it justbroken? I find the shadows of the hand and cube a bit distracting, whereas the overall lighting is so much better.', '2007-12-29 03:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342451, 625514, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of this character. shows all the details.</td>', 'Nice shot of this character. shows all the details.', '2007-12-29 03:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342452, 626100, 70689, '<td valign="top">One of many film pics in the challenge. I like this on best because of the explixit word ''Digital'' in the book title and because the film and ribbon form a nice pattern together. I would have liked a slightly more subtle lighting though.</td>', 'One of many film pics in the challenge. I like this on best because of the explixit word ''Digital'' in the book title and because the film and ribbon form a nice pattern together. I would have liked a slightly more subtle lighting though.', '2007-12-29 04:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342464, 625656, 30982, '<td valign="top">The expression is excellent!</td>', 'The expression is excellent!', '2007-12-29 04:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342466, 626101, 30982, '<td valign="top">Aww, c''mon, it looks good on you!</td>', 'Aww, c''mon, it looks good on you!', '2007-12-29 04:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342467, 625605, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh!  She does look a bit miffed.</td>', 'Heh!  She does look a bit miffed.', '2007-12-29 04:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342469, 625959, 70689, '<td valign="top">I am afraid this picture suffers from quite some technical problems. First of all, lighting is very harsh, leading to white that hurts the eyes and harsh shadows. You may want to consider a simple sollution like putting a tissue in front of your flash. Second, the focus in the picture seems to be on the bag rather than the book, whereas the book is supposed to be the main subject. Third, the crop is very tight, giving the pic a restless ''feel''.<br/> <br/> <br/>PS Please be more carefull with your school gear ;-)</td>', 'I am afraid this picture suffers from quite some technical problems. First of all, lighting is very harsh, leading to white that hurts the eyes and harsh shadows. You may want to consider a simple sollution like putting a tissue in front of your flash. Second, the focus in the picture seems to be on the bag rather than the book, whereas the book is supposed to be the main subject. Third, the crop is very tight, giving the pic a restless ''feel''.  PS Please be more carefull with your school gear ;-)', '2007-12-29 04:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342470, 626039, 70689, '<td valign="top">hmmm, not a very appealing pic, alhough some people may like the weird POV and concept. I do appreciate the weird nature of the pic, but I am bit put of by the harsh shadows and the many distractions. As to PP, I think it is generally strong, but it seems to be overdone relative to the IQ of the original picture. I would love the see you repeat this type of PP to a well-lit portrait someday.</td>', 'hmmm, not a very appealing pic, alhough some people may like the weird POV and concept. I do appreciate the weird nature of the pic, but I am bit put of by the harsh shadows and the many distractions. As to PP, I think it is generally strong, but it seems to be overdone relative to the IQ of the original picture. I would love the see you repeat this type of PP to a well-lit portrait someday.', '2007-12-29 04:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342472, 625907, 30982, '<td valign="top">Those are darn cute socks!!  And if you have cats, guaranteed to drive them nuts with the bells.</td>', 'Those are darn cute socks!!  And if you have cats, guaranteed to drive them nuts with the bells.', '2007-12-29 04:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342473, 626100, 30982, '<td valign="top">The book isn''t a stupid gift... Oh, and it''s always best if the film isn''t exposed before you stick it in the camera... hard to get the digits to stick when it''s pre-exposed...</td>', 'The book isn''t a stupid gift... Oh, and it''s always best if the film isn''t exposed before you stick it in the camera... hard to get the digits to stick when it''s pre-exposed...', '2007-12-29 04:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342474, 625600, 30982, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, maybe it''s just me, but I don''t think money is ever a stupid gift!</td>', 'Hmmm, maybe it''s just me, but I don''t think money is ever a stupid gift!', '2007-12-29 04:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342475, 625536, 70689, '<td valign="top">I am sorry to say I don''t like this picture much. I''m especially not too fond of the halo around the bear. I also dislike the central placement and he fact that you cropped of the poor bear''s paw below.</td>', 'I am sorry to say I don''t like this picture much. I''m especially not too fond of the halo around the bear. I also dislike the central placement and he fact that you cropped of the poor bear''s paw below.', '2007-12-29 04:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
