(4342503, 625685, 30982, '<td valign="top">Not sure if it''s the light or the editing, but it almost looks as though the boat has been pasted onto the background.</td>', 'Not sure if it''s the light or the editing, but it almost looks as though the boat has been pasted onto the background.', '2007-12-29 05:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
