(4342546, 625903, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is very much an excellent response to this challenge!  You''ve captured the true spirit of, well, family dynamics, Christmas, odd gifts - you name it!  Nicely done, and one of my top picks for this challenge.</td>', 'This is very much an excellent response to this challenge!  You''ve captured the true spirit of, well, family dynamics, Christmas, odd gifts - you name it!  Nicely done, and one of my top picks for this challenge.', '2007-12-29 06:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
