(4342549, 625849, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is an altogether perfect Christmas morning picture.  I love the look on the young man''s face, and the fact Grandpa is in the background.  I like the motion and the busy-ness of the whole thing alot.  The only suggestion I would make is to clone or tone down the object on the table next to Grandpa, then I''d say you print this as a keeper!</td>', 'This is an altogether perfect Christmas morning picture.  I love the look on the young man''s face, and the fact Grandpa is in the background.  I like the motion and the busy-ness of the whole thing alot.  The only suggestion I would make is to clone or tone down the object on the table next to Grandpa, then I''d say you print this as a keeper!', '2007-12-29 06:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342550, 625703, 30982, '<td valign="top">Cute, and extremely well executed.</td>', 'Cute, and extremely well executed.', '2007-12-29 06:47:24.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4342560, 625863, 42181, '<td valign="top">"The very best" i bet that is a very short album ;-)</td>', '"The very best" i bet that is a very short album ;-)', '2007-12-29 07:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342582, 625872, 70689, '<td valign="top">Nor sure from the pic whether these are socks, towels or any other type of cloth. ANd you''ll have to agree that if I can''t see what is depicted in a photograph, it''s probably not a very good one, unless it''s an abstract. I think this pic has two main problems: <br/>1) lighting, or better, the reflection of light from the plastic<br/>2) composition: in the sense that it lacks one. I am sorry to say it this rude, but I realy feel you should have devoted some time to creating a nice composition and show the viewer that these are actually socks.</td>', 'Nor sure from the pic whether these are socks, towels or any other type of cloth. ANd you''ll have to agree that if I can''t see what is depicted in a photograph, it''s probably not a very good one, unless it''s an abstract. I think this pic has two main problems: 1) lighting, or better, the reflection of light from the plastic2) composition: in the sense that it lacks one. I am sorry to say it this rude, but I realy feel you should have devoted some time to creating a nice composition and show the viewer that these are actually socks.', '2007-12-29 07:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342586, 625571, 70689, '<td valign="top">I am not too fond of photographs where someone simply makes a flat pic of something. You might as well put it under the copier. Please devote more time to composition and lighting to make your subject stand out and generate an appealing picture.</td>', 'I am not too fond of photographs where someone simply makes a flat pic of something. You might as well put it under the copier. Please devote more time to composition and lighting to make your subject stand out and generate an appealing picture.', '2007-12-29 07:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342680, 626129, 70689, '<td valign="top">That IS a stupid gift, I have to agree :D I like your title too, but I am not too fond of the pic, I must say. It think it would benefit from a more exciting composition than just the cat plain in the middle of the pic. I also feel there is something wrong in the lighting. The pic lacks contrast overall, but the cat ON the CD has blown out highlights, thus directing the eyes of the viewer to the CD, rather than to the face of the real cat. On top of all that, you chopped of one of the eartips.</td>', 'That IS a stupid gift, I have to agree :D I like your title too, but I am not too fond of the pic, I must say. It think it would benefit from a more exciting composition than just the cat plain in the middle of the pic. I also feel there is something wrong in the lighting. The pic lacks contrast overall, but the cat ON the CD has blown out highlights, thus directing the eyes of the viewer to the CD, rather than to the face of the real cat. On top of all that, you chopped of one of the eartips.', '2007-12-29 08:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342695, 626101, 70689, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the expression is fitting, but the pic does not seem to be in focus and the (oversharpened?) glitters and glimmers are very distracting. They seem to move from right to left.</td>', 'I like the idea and the expression is fitting, but the pic does not seem to be in focus and the (oversharpened?) glitters and glimmers are very distracting. They seem to move from right to left.', '2007-12-29 09:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342707, 625875, 70689, '<td valign="top">It''s hard -if not impossible- to make a pleasant composition from things still in the box. I think you should have taken them out. That would also help the viewer to see there are only seven pons. Some of the whites are slightly blown in the picture and the whites have a blue cast, indicating that your WB is incorrect.</td>', 'It''s hard -if not impossible- to make a pleasant composition from things still in the box. I think you should have taken them out. That would also help the viewer to see there are only seven pons. Some of the whites are slightly blown in the picture and the whites have a blue cast, indicating that your WB is incorrect.', '2007-12-29 09:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342717, 625788, 65234, '<td valign="top">I collect unusual elephant figurines, so I would have been pleased with this gift.  Takes all kinds, doesn''t it?  Photo is a little noisy and I''d like a little more detail on the pachyderms; maybe a slightly lower angle so I could see their little faces better.</td>', 'I collect unusual elephant figurines, so I would have been pleased with this gift.  Takes all kinds, doesn''t it?  Photo is a little noisy and I''d like a little more detail on the pachyderms; maybe a slightly lower angle so I could see their little faces better.', '2007-12-29 09:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342718, 626182, 65234, '<td valign="top">Myabe someone wants you to switch to leather ;-p  Bit of reflection on the kit is washing it out on top; it could use more contrast/saturation there.</td>', 'Myabe someone wants you to switch to leather ;-p  Bit of reflection on the kit is washing it out on top; it could use more contrast/saturation there.', '2007-12-29 09:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342720, 626176, 70689, '<td valign="top">Yep, that''s a silly gift. I don''t like the harsh lighting and shadow though, nor the very central composition. This litlle item could hve been displayed in a much more spectacular way IMO. How about a low angle close-up for instance? That would have also given you the oppotunity to create a larger pic, which would have worked better.</td>', 'Yep, that''s a silly gift. I don''t like the harsh lighting and shadow though, nor the very central composition. This litlle item could hve been displayed in a much more spectacular way IMO. How about a low angle close-up for instance? That would have also given you the oppotunity to create a larger pic, which would have worked better.', '2007-12-29 09:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342721, 625636, 65234, '<td valign="top">Santa''s hat has a paw embroidered on it?  Cute shot; whites are a little blown on my screen and I would crop tighter, esp. on the right.</td>', 'Santa''s hat has a paw embroidered on it?  Cute shot; whites are a little blown on my screen and I would crop tighter, esp. on the right.', '2007-12-29 09:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342722, 626155, 65234, '<td valign="top">Oh, but he''s CUTE!  Very nice shot of him in the midst of fluff.</td>', 'Oh, but he''s CUTE!  Very nice shot of him in the midst of fluff.', '2007-12-29 09:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342723, 626093, 65234, '<td valign="top">Dunno'', which would you prefer?  Nice composition.</td>', 'Dunno'', which would you prefer?  Nice composition.', '2007-12-29 09:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342725, 625998, 65234, '<td valign="top">My son got my husband a Mr. Hanky tie once.  He''s never worn it.  Certainly would qualify as a useless gift for many, many people :-)  Bit of a glare on the cover is detracting a bit from the image itself.</td>', 'My son got my husband a Mr. Hanky tie once.  He''s never worn it.  Certainly would qualify as a useless gift for many, many people :-)  Bit of a glare on the cover is detracting a bit from the image itself.', '2007-12-29 09:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342727, 626198, 70689, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and styling, but the execution deserves a lttle more attention. Not quite sure what you did whith the bg for instance, but it looks messy, as if you dodged and burned it carelessly. Bot hands are in awkward position, and it seems your right hand comes from outside the picture. Other (minor) technicalities include the flash reflection on the magazine and the tight crop on the upper side.</td>', 'Nice idea and styling, but the execution deserves a lttle more attention. Not quite sure what you did whith the bg for instance, but it looks messy, as if you dodged and burned it carelessly. Bot hands are in awkward position, and it seems your right hand comes from outside the picture. Other (minor) technicalities include the flash reflection on the magazine and the tight crop on the upper side.', '2007-12-29 09:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342729, 626061, 65234, '<td valign="top">Well at least it could be useful ...</td>', 'Well at least it could be useful ...', '2007-12-29 09:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342732, 626022, 70689, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit snapshottish to me. As if your dad/grandad/husband/whatever fell asleep and you took a sneaky picture with a rubber duckey. The picture lacks contrast and could have been enhanced by paying more attention to lighting and composition.<br/> <br/>Oh, btw, the duck is for bathing. ;-)</td>', 'Looks a bit snapshottish to me. As if your dad/grandad/husband/whatever fell asleep and you took a sneaky picture with a rubber duckey. The picture lacks contrast and could have been enhanced by paying more attention to lighting and composition. Oh, btw, the duck is for bathing. ;-)', '2007-12-29 09:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342734, 626130, 65234, '<td valign="top">I see you chose a quiet place to celebrate the holiday.  Different.</td>', 'I see you chose a quiet place to celebrate the holiday.  Different.', '2007-12-29 09:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342737, 626129, 65234, '<td valign="top">No, we obviously are not.  Lighting is a bit bright and kitty''s eyes need the pupils made more black than green; shallower DOF and tighter crop would also really empahsize that Pissed Off Kitty look.</td>', 'No, we obviously are not.  Lighting is a bit bright and kitty''s eyes need the pupils made more black than green; shallower DOF and tighter crop would also really empahsize that Pissed Off Kitty look.', '2007-12-29 09:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342740, 626140, 65234, '<td valign="top">Aw, gosh, it''s ... it''s ... unique, at any rate.  I don''t have one, but then I don''t want one.</td>', 'Aw, gosh, it''s ... it''s ... unique, at any rate.  I don''t have one, but then I don''t want one.', '2007-12-29 09:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342743, 625901, 65234, '<td valign="top">I have one of those!  We call it the Magic Martian, and it''s what I use to get dogs to look at me and cock their little heads cutely in portraits.  Never mind the dog; YOU should keep it!  Looks a bit big for him, anyway ;-)</td>', 'I have one of those!  We call it the Magic Martian, and it''s what I use to get dogs to look at me and cock their little heads cutely in portraits.  Never mind the dog; YOU should keep it!  Looks a bit big for him, anyway ;-)', '2007-12-29 09:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342745, 626005, 65234, '<td valign="top">It''s nicely wrapped, at least.  And I think it''s better than garlic, or worse still, a garlic necklace for your spouse ;-)</td>', 'It''s nicely wrapped, at least.  And I think it''s better than garlic, or worse still, a garlic necklace for your spouse ;-)', '2007-12-29 09:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342749, 625805, 70689, '<td valign="top">I don''t realy know where to begin my comment, so let me start by stating that I will vote this pic higher than I would based on technical aspects alone. Why? Because you managed to capture the fun and if a picture captures emotion, it can''t be all that bad.<br/> <br/>Now let me try and help you make a better shot next time. First of all, be very carefull using your onboard cam. The least you should do is diffuse the light by holding or taping a folded tissue in front of it. Other methods of relefecting and dicffusing light may also help to avoid shiny skins and harsh shadows. Second, try to keep your final composition in mind. A simple but very effective rule for portaits is to keep the eyes of the main person at 2/3 of the pic''s height, width or both. Third, if you are shooting more than one person, use a slightly higher f-number in order to keep the second person in focus as well.<br/> <br/>Hope this is of any use to you.</td>', 'I don''t realy know where to begin my comment, so let me start by stating that I will vote this pic higher than I would based on technical aspects alone. Why? Because you managed to capture the fun and if a picture captures emotion, it can''t be all that bad. Now let me try and help you make a better shot next time. First of all, be very carefull using your onboard cam. The least you should do is diffuse the light by holding or taping a folded tissue in front of it. Other methods of relefecting and dicffusing light may also help to avoid shiny skins and harsh shadows. Second, try to keep your final composition in mind. A simple but very effective rule for portaits is to keep the eyes of the main person at 2/3 of the pic''s height, width or both. Third, if you are shooting more than one person, use a slightly higher f-number in order to keep the second person in focus as well. Hope this is of any use to you.', '2007-12-29 09:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342750, 625596, 70689, '<td valign="top">Funny. Not a very good pic though: small, greyish and the highlights draw the attention away from the actual subject</td>', 'Funny. Not a very good pic though: small, greyish and the highlights draw the attention away from the actual subject', '2007-12-29 09:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342755, 626148, 70689, '<td valign="top">In the darker days of the year, many photogs turn to artificial light, and not everyone of us has the money (or financial priority) to buy strobes or sophisticated flashes. Now, the onboard flash of the camera seems to come in handy. But they don''t. Onboard flashes kill pictures: they create shiny skins and hars shadows. Your pic suffers from theze features as well. There are simple, cheap and fairly effective ways to handle this, for instance by putting a tissue in front of the flash to soften and diffuse the light. Other techniques to soften or reflect light may be helpfull too.</td>', 'In the darker days of the year, many photogs turn to artificial light, and not everyone of us has the money (or financial priority) to buy strobes or sophisticated flashes. Now, the onboard flash of the camera seems to come in handy. But they don''t. Onboard flashes kill pictures: they create shiny skins and hars shadows. Your pic suffers from theze features as well. There are simple, cheap and fairly effective ways to handle this, for instance by putting a tissue in front of the flash to soften and diffuse the light. Other techniques to soften or reflect light may be helpfull too.', '2007-12-29 09:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342756, 625927, 70689, '<td valign="top">In the darker days of the year, many photogs turn to artificial light, and not everyone of us has the money (or financial priority) to buy strobes or sophisticated flashes. Now, the onboard flash of the camera seems to come in handy. But they don''t. Onboard flashes kill pictures: they create shiny skins and hars shadows. Your pic suffers from theze features as well. There are simple, cheap and fairly effective ways to handle this, for instance by putting a tissue in front of the flash to soften and diffuse the light. Other techniques to soften or reflect light may be helpfull too.</td>', 'In the darker days of the year, many photogs turn to artificial light, and not everyone of us has the money (or financial priority) to buy strobes or sophisticated flashes. Now, the onboard flash of the camera seems to come in handy. But they don''t. Onboard flashes kill pictures: they create shiny skins and hars shadows. Your pic suffers from theze features as well. There are simple, cheap and fairly effective ways to handle this, for instance by putting a tissue in front of the flash to soften and diffuse the light. Other techniques to soften or reflect light may be helpfull too.', '2007-12-29 09:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342761, 626087, 70689, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but I think the picture is too dark in general, except for the door, which is too light. This makes the eye of the viewer turn to the door, instead of to the scene in front.</td>', 'I like the idea, but I think the picture is too dark in general, except for the door, which is too light. This makes the eye of the viewer turn to the door, instead of to the scene in front.', '2007-12-29 10:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
