(4342774, 625513, 65234, '<td valign="top">YES, a Chia pet!  And a bonus gift, you lucky fellow, you.  (You know there''s a Shrek version now, too, in case someone needs to add to your collection next year. I just thought I''d start your 2008 gift list, as a favor, of course, to a collector of such obviously refined taste.)  Great composition and expression, BTW.</td>', 'YES, a Chia pet!  And a bonus gift, you lucky fellow, you.  (You know there''s a Shrek version now, too, in case someone needs to add to your collection next year. I just thought I''d start your 2008 gift list, as a favor, of course, to a collector of such obviously refined taste.)  Great composition and expression, BTW.', '2007-12-29 10:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4342776, 626142, 65234, '<td valign="top">Yet another thing you can shoot your eye out with!  You can never have too many of those.  Um, do they fly on their wn?  I''m a little unnerved by the one flying above the shooter ... maybe you got two and someone else is helping you test them out ;-)</td>', 'Yet another thing you can shoot your eye out with!  You can never have too many of those.  Um, do they fly on their wn?  I''m a little unnerved by the one flying above the shooter ... maybe you got two and someone else is helping you test them out ;-)', '2007-12-29 10:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
