(4343120, 626063, 70689, '<td valign="top">You must have noticed yourself that this pic is noisy and blurred. Why not lower your ISO, punt the cam on a tripod or stack of books and use a long exposure instead?</td>', 'You must have noticed yourself that this pic is noisy and blurred. Why not lower your ISO, punt the cam on a tripod or stack of books and use a long exposure instead?', '2007-12-29 14:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
