(4343232, 626142, 6817, '<td valign="top">Maybe it''s just me, but I don''t get the chicken on the right flying "toward" the face. I''d understand if it were falling away, as if it had hit the face and bounced off. That said. I do like the muted color of the person and vivid color of the chicken and gun. Nice image.</td>', 'Maybe it''s just me, but I don''t get the chicken on the right flying "toward" the face. I''d understand if it were falling away, as if it had hit the face and bounced off. That said. I do like the muted color of the person and vivid color of the chicken and gun. Nice image.', '2007-12-29 14:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
