(4344452, 626040, 54548, '<td valign="top">It might have made the picture a bit stronger if the cigar bud in the middle was better focused ...</td>', 'It might have made the picture a bit stronger if the cigar bud in the middle was better focused ...', '2007-12-30 02:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344455, 625567, 54548, '<td valign="top">LOL! This is amazing!</td>', 'LOL! This is amazing!', '2007-12-30 02:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344491, 625864, 70689, '<td valign="top">Great expression and the look up combined with the level POV works well. The picture is not entirely sharp @ the eyes and it seems you tried just a tad too hard to save it with USM, but the expression makes up for that.</td>', 'Great expression and the look up combined with the level POV works well. The picture is not entirely sharp @ the eyes and it seems you tried just a tad too hard to save it with USM, but the expression makes up for that.', '2007-12-30 03:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344492, 625945, 70689, '<td valign="top">Great timing. I think the face is a tiny bit too dark and the sky is either blown out or overprocessed, but it''s not very disturbing.</td>', 'Great timing. I think the face is a tiny bit too dark and the sky is either blown out or overprocessed, but it''s not very disturbing.', '2007-12-30 03:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344498, 625511, 70689, '<td valign="top">I like the low perspective here, making it look huge. The diagonals work well in the picture, though a tighter crop on the right may make it even stronger. There´s some spots in you pic, you could have cloned them out under advanced editing, and I would have removed the bear hanging from the key before shooting.</td>', 'I like the low perspective here, making it look huge. The diagonals work well in the picture, though a tighter crop on the right may make it even stronger. There´s some spots in you pic, you could have cloned them out under advanced editing, and I would have removed the bear hanging from the key before shooting.', '2007-12-30 03:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344499, 626071, 70689, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and overall well executed. Nothing exciting in terms of composition though and the wrapping paper is clearly used before, reducing the credibility of the pic.</td>', 'Nice idea and overall well executed. Nothing exciting in terms of composition though and the wrapping paper is clearly used before, reducing the credibility of the pic.', '2007-12-30 03:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344507, 626155, 70689, '<td valign="top">Nice pic of a cute little doggie. I am afraid the pig is a tad too messy to be realy good. Especially the red thing growing out of doggie''s head is disturbing</td>', 'Nice pic of a cute little doggie. I am afraid the pig is a tad too messy to be realy good. Especially the red thing growing out of doggie''s head is disturbing', '2007-12-30 04:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344508, 625529, 70689, '<td valign="top">The moralism in this pic is likely to affect your score, but I bet you won''t care. I like the execution of the shot. It''s well-lit and the transition from smoke to skull looks failry natural. The big empty black space is functional as well. I have two minor issues with this pic: I think it is strange that the sigaret just hangs there and I think the pic would have been more convincing if the sigaret was burned only halfway.</td>', 'The moralism in this pic is likely to affect your score, but I bet you won''t care. I like the execution of the shot. It''s well-lit and the transition from smoke to skull looks failry natural. The big empty black space is functional as well. I have two minor issues with this pic: I think it is strange that the sigaret just hangs there and I think the pic would have been more convincing if the sigaret was burned only halfway.', '2007-12-30 04:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344509, 626059, 70689, '<td valign="top">In the darker days of the year, many photogs turn to artificial light, and not everyone of us has the money (or financial priority) to buy strobes or sophisticated flashes. Now, the onboard flash of the camera seems to come in handy. But they don''t. Onboard flashes kill pictures: they create shiny skins and hars shadows. Your pic suffers from theze features as well. There are simple, cheap and fairly effective ways to handle this, for instance by putting a tissue in front of the flash to soften and diffuse the light. Other techniques to soften or reflect light may be helpfull too.</td>', 'In the darker days of the year, many photogs turn to artificial light, and not everyone of us has the money (or financial priority) to buy strobes or sophisticated flashes. Now, the onboard flash of the camera seems to come in handy. But they don''t. Onboard flashes kill pictures: they create shiny skins and hars shadows. Your pic suffers from theze features as well. There are simple, cheap and fairly effective ways to handle this, for instance by putting a tissue in front of the flash to soften and diffuse the light. Other techniques to soften or reflect light may be helpfull too.', '2007-12-30 04:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344510, 625642, 70689, '<td valign="top">Some nice irony in there. :) I like the diagonal and ''expression'' on santa''s face, but I would have liked to see a ittle more depth (through DOF, lighting or composition) in the picture.</td>', 'Some nice irony in there. :) I like the diagonal and ''expression'' on santa''s face, but I would have liked to see a ittle more depth (through DOF, lighting or composition) in the picture.', '2007-12-30 04:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4344511, 625635, 70689, '<td valign="top">Nice. Vivid color on black works well. I am not realy excited about the composition though and I see some pixelations in the black beackground.</td>', 'Nice. Vivid color on black works well. I am not realy excited about the composition though and I see some pixelations in the black beackground.', '2007-12-30 04:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
